name wsd-candidates
# Data_Validation/candidatesWN30.txt. Data_Validation/README says of it only that ValidateGold "will check that all
# gold keys are in fact candidate synsets from the given lemma in WordNet 3.0"; nothing names its fields, which are
# parted by tabs: a lemma, a letter, and one sense key or more. Each line is recorded as the tuple of its fields, in
# its own order.
match candidatesWN30.txt
grammar table

claims
row tuple
